    },
    "Back-first interval" : {
      "comment" : "A column of the Cards window: how long a card that goes both ways waits after its last review back first.\nIn the Cards window's detail: how long a card that goes both ways waits after its last review back first.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
