            "value" : "La tarjeta %lld no se puede ubicar como respuesta: solo una importación ubica una tarjeta. No se guardó nada. Reportalo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Card %lld changed outside the review panel, so ⌘Z can't undo it. Close the review panel and open “Review now” again." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
