    "Default" : {
      "comment" : "The deck a card lives in when it has no other.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Predeterminado"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Default holds the cards no other deck does, so it can't be renamed, moved or deleted, and nothing changed. To go on, make a deck of your own and move Default's cards there." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Predeterminado guarda las tarjetas que no están en ningún otro mazo, así que no se puede renombrar, mover ni eliminar, y no cambió nada. Para seguir, creá un mazo propio y mové ahí las tarjetas de Predeterminado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete" : {
