    "Due" : {
      "comment" : "A column of the Cards window: when the card is due.\nIn the Cards window's detail: when the card is due.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pendiente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each “Again” to a card out of its learning and relearning steps counts, since the card's front or back last changed. If you don't flag it, the panel offers again after half as many more." : {
      "comment" : "Settings, under Review panel: below the offer to flag a card forgotten often, which counts Anki's lapses. “Again” is the review panel's button, as Anki names it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuenta cada «Otra vez» a una tarjeta fuera de sus pasos en la etapa de aprendizaje y de reaprendizaje, desde la última vez que cambió su anverso o su reverso. Si no la marcás, el panel lo vuelve a ofrecer cuando sume la mitad de esa cantidad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Easy" : {
      "comment" : "A rating, Anki's fourth button, as the review panel's button names it and the Cards window's review log shows it: Lucas knew the card at once. Anki's own name for it, “Fácil” in Spanish.",
