    "That holds no sound Ficha can read. Drag or paste a sound or a video with sound instead, such as an MP3, an M4A or a MOV." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eso no tiene ningún sonido que Ficha pueda leer. Arrastrá o pegá un sonido o un video con sonido en su lugar, como un MP3, un M4A o un MOV."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That isn't an image Ficha can read. Drag or paste a picture instead, such as a JPEG or a PNG." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esa no es una imagen que Ficha pueda leer. Arrastrá o pegá una imagen en su lugar, como un JPEG o un PNG."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That isn't one emoji. Pick just one, or leave the field empty for none." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eso no es un solo emoji. Elegí uno solo, o dejá el campo vacío para ninguno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That type was deleted meanwhile, maybe on another of your devices, so nothing changed. Pick another type." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ese tipo se eliminó mientras tanto, quizás en otro de tus dispositivos, así que no cambió nada. Elegí otro tipo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That would leave card %lld with a blank front or back, so nothing changed: give each side text, an image or a sound." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eso dejaría la tarjeta %lld con el anverso o el reverso en blanco, así que no cambió nada: dale a cada lado un texto, una imagen o un sonido."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The #%@ line of “%@” says “%@”, which isn't a column's number. Make it the number of the column, counting the first one as 1." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La línea #%1$@ de «%2$@» dice «%3$@», que no es un número de columna. Cambiala al número de la columna, contando la primera como 1."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The #columns line of “%@” names no %@ column, which every card needs. Name its columns Front, Back, Tags, Type and Source, or remove the line." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La línea #columns de «%1$@» no nombra ninguna columna %2$@, que toda tarjeta necesita. Nombrá sus columnas Front, Back, Tags, Type y Source, o quitá la línea."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The #html line of “%@” says “%@”: make it true when the file holds HTML, or false when it doesn't." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La línea #html de «%1$@» dice «%2$@»: cambiala a true si el archivo tiene HTML, o a false si no."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The #separator line of “%@” says “%@”, which Ficha can't separate columns by. Make it Tab, Comma or Semicolon, or remove it." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La línea #separator de «%1$@» dice «%2$@», y Ficha no puede separar columnas con eso. Cambiala a Tab, Comma o Semicolon, o quitala."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %lld decks inside it go with it." : {
      "comment" : "In the Cards window's question before it deletes a deck: the decks inside it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
