    "The back has a sound" : {
      "comment" : "The tooltip of the speaker in the Cards window's Media column, when the card's back has one.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El reverso tiene un sonido"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The back has an image" : {
      "comment" : "The tooltip of the photo in the Cards window's Media column, when the card's back has one.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El reverso tiene una imagen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera or the microphone in use" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La cámara o el micrófono en uso"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The capture is empty: write what you want to remember." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La captura está vacía: escribí lo que querés recordar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The capture stays in the inbox until you add a card from it." : {
      "comment" : "In the Cards window's card form opened from a capture, before any card was added.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La captura queda en la bandeja hasta que agregues una tarjeta a partir de ella."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The capture this form was opened from left the inbox outside this window meanwhile, approved or discarded in a refine session, so the card wasn't added. To keep what you typed, copy it before you close the form." : {
      "comment" : "An alert's message over the Cards window's card form, when its capture already left the inbox.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La captura desde la que se abrió este formulario salió de la bandeja fuera de esta ventana mientras tanto, aprobada o descartada en una sesión de refinado, así que no se agregó la tarjeta. Para conservar lo que escribiste, copialo antes de cerrar el formulario."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cards bring new types: %@." : {
      "comment" : "In the Import sheet's preview of a text file, with the names of the card types of the user's own the import makes, as a list, since the user has no type by those names.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las tarjetas traen tipos nuevos: %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cards come into these decks:" : {
      "comment" : "In the Import sheet's preview, above the decks its cards come into, an Anki package's or a text file's, each in a field the user renames.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las tarjetas entran en estos mazos:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cards get these tags, from Anki's notes:" : {
      "comment" : "In the Import sheet's preview of an Anki package, above the tags its cards get.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las tarjetas reciben estas etiquetas, de las notas de Anki:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cards you create with New Card show up here, and the ones you bury, in Buried." : {
      "comment" : "In the Cards window, when All cards is empty.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las tarjetas que creás con Nueva tarjeta aparecen acá, y las que enterrás, en Enterradas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The deck “%@” isn't there any more, maybe since another of your devices renamed or deleted it, so nothing changed. Look for it among your decks under its new name, or pick another." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El mazo «%@» ya no está, quizás porque otro de tus dispositivos lo renombró o lo eliminó, así que no cambió nada. Buscalo entre tus mazos con su nombre nuevo, o elegí otro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The front has a sound" : {
      "comment" : "The tooltip of the speaker in the Cards window's Media column, when the card's front has one.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El anverso tiene un sonido"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The front has an image" : {
      "comment" : "The tooltip of the photo in the Cards window's Media column, when the card's front has one.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El anverso tiene una imagen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tags you write on your cards show up here." : {
      "comment" : "In the Cards window's All Tags, when no card has a tag.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las etiquetas que escribís en tus tarjetas aparecen acá."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their images and sounds weigh %@, and go up to your iCloud." : {
      "comment" : "In the Import sheet's preview while sync is on: what the images and sounds the import brings, which go up to the user's iCloud, weigh, said from 100 MB.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sus imágenes y sonidos pesan %@, y suben a tu iCloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their review logs go too, and you can't bring them back." : {
      "comment" : "Under the title of the Cards window's question before it deletes several cards.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "También se van sus historiales de repasos, y no los podés recuperar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then wait" : {
      "comment" : "Settings, under Hold appearances back during: how long an appearance waits once a meeting, a video, a full-screen app or a Focus ends.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Después, esperar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's no card with the id %lld: it was deleted, or it never existed. Check the card's id." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No hay ninguna tarjeta con el id %lld: se eliminó, o nunca existió. Revisá el id de la tarjeta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's no copy named “%@” in Ficha's Backups folder: it was moved or deleted. Check which copies are there." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No hay ninguna copia llamada «%@» en la carpeta Backups de Ficha: se movió o se eliminó. Revisá qué copias hay."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's no file at “%@”. Check the path: a path that doesn't start with / or ~ starts from the folder the command runs in." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No hay ningún archivo en «%@». Revisá la ruta: una ruta que no empieza con / o ~ parte de la carpeta donde corre el comando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac had cards before it ever synced, so sync waits for you. Turning it on sends all your cards to your iCloud." : {
      "comment" : "Settings, under Sync, on a Mac that had cards before it ever synced, which left sync off: turning it on sends every card.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta Mac tenía tarjetas antes de sincronizar por primera vez, así que la sincronización te espera. Activarla envía todas tus tarjetas a tu iCloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac had cards before it ever synced, so sync waits for you. Turning it on sends the cards in the decks you choose to your iCloud." : {
      "comment" : "Settings, under Sync, on a Mac that had cards before it ever synced, which left sync off: turning it on sends the cards in ticked decks.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta Mac tenía tarjetas antes de sincronizar por primera vez, así que la sincronización te espera. Activarla envía a tu iCloud las tarjetas de los mazos que elijas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build isn't signed with its App Group, whose folder holds its cards. Install Ficha from TestFlight, or build Ficha Dev with make run, with your team's ID in iPhone/Local.xcconfig, as docs/development.md says." : {
      "comment" : "An alert at launch, which only a build made by hand without the developer's team shows. TestFlight is Apple's app, make run a command, iPhone/Local.xcconfig a file and docs/development.md a document, whose names stay as they are.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta compilación no está firmada con su App Group, cuya carpeta guarda sus tarjetas. Instalá Ficha desde TestFlight, o compilá Ficha Dev con make run, con el ID de tu equipo en iPhone/Local.xcconfig, como dice docs/development.md."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This capture left the inbox outside this window meanwhile, approved or discarded in a refine session, so nothing was saved. To keep what you typed, copy it before you cancel." : {
      "comment" : "An alert's message in the Cards window, when the capture Lucas saves already left the inbox.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta captura salió de la bandeja fuera de esta ventana mientras tanto, aprobada o descartada en una sesión de refinado, así que no se guardó nada. Para conservar lo que escribiste, copialo antes de cancelar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This capture left the inbox outside this window meanwhile, approved or discarded in a refine session, so there's nothing to discard. The window now shows the inbox as it is." : {
      "comment" : "An alert's message in the Cards window, when the capture Lucas discards already left the inbox.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta captura salió de la bandeja fuera de esta ventana mientras tanto, aprobada o descartada en una sesión de refinado, así que no hay nada que descartar. La ventana ahora muestra la bandeja como está."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This capture left the inbox outside this window meanwhile, approved or discarded in a refine session. The cards you added from it are saved." : {
      "comment" : "An alert's message in the Cards window, after closing the card form, when its capture already left the inbox.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta captura salió de la bandeja fuera de esta ventana mientras tanto, aprobada o descartada en una sesión de refinado. Las tarjetas que agregaste a partir de ella están guardadas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This card was deleted meanwhile, in the Cards window. Close the review panel and open “Review now” again." : {
      "comment" : "An alert's message in the review panel, when the card it shows was deleted meanwhile.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta tarjeta se eliminó mientras tanto, en la ventana Tarjetas. Cerrá el panel de repaso y volvé a abrir «Repasar ahora»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy of Ficha is missing its instructions for an AI. Install Ficha again, or read them in Ficha's repository on GitHub, in docs/instructions-for-an-ai.md." : {
      "comment" : "An alert's message in the Import sheet, when the app has no instructions for an AI.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A esta copia de Ficha le faltan sus instrucciones para una IA. Volvé a instalar Ficha, o leelas en el repositorio de Ficha en GitHub, en docs/instructions-for-an-ai.md."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is already in the inbox" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto ya está en la bandeja"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This repeats a card" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto repite una tarjeta"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To undo it, restore the copy saved before it, in Settings › Backups." : {
      "comment" : "In the Import sheet once it's done, when Ficha saved a copy before the import.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para deshacerla, restaurá la copia guardada antes, en Configuración › Respaldos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn Off Both Ways" : {
      "comment" : "A button of the Cards window that has the selected cards reviewed front first only, no longer back first too.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Desactivar En ambos sentidos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn Off Both Ways (⌘B)" : {
      "comment" : "The tooltip of the Cards window's button that turns Both ways off for the cards.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Desactivar En ambos sentidos (⌘B)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn Off the Capture Shortcut" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Desactivar el atajo de captura"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On Both Ways" : {
      "comment" : "A button of the Cards window that has the selected cards also reviewed back first: their back, then their front.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Activar En ambos sentidos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn On Both Ways (⌘B)" : {
      "comment" : "The tooltip of the Cards window's button that turns Both ways on for the cards.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Activar En ambos sentidos (⌘B)"
