        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sentido"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What do you want to know?" : {
      "comment" : "The prompt of the field where the user writes a question about the card the review panel shows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Qué querés saber?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What needs fixing?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¿Qué hay que corregir?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you capture, and the cards you flag, wait here to be refined." : {
      "comment" : "In the Cards window, when the inbox is empty.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lo que capturás, y las tarjetas que marcás, esperan acá para refinarse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When it shows up on its own. Opened with Review now, it takes the keyboard at once." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando aparece por su cuenta. Si lo abrís con Repasar ahora, toma el teclado enseguida."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With review now" : {
      "comment" : "In Diagnostics: Lucas opened the review panel with Review now, from the menu or the Shortcuts app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Con Repasar ahora"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Word" : {
      "comment" : "A card type.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Palabra"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words" : {
      "comment" : "An item of the Cards window's sidebar: the word cards.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Palabras"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write “::” between a deck and a deck inside it, as in “Idiomas::Inglés”." : {
      "comment" : "Under the title of the Cards window's sheet that names a new deck, after New Deck…, or of the Change Deck or Import sheet while it names one.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Escribí «::» entre un mazo y un mazo de adentro, como en «Idiomas::Inglés»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write “::” between a deck and a deck inside it, as in “Idiomas::Inglés”. The decks inside this one move with it, and a name another deck has joins the two." : {
      "comment" : "Under the title of the Cards window's sheet that renames a deck.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Escribí «::» entre un mazo y un mazo de adentro, como en «Idiomas::Inglés». Los mazos de adentro de este se mueven con él, y un nombre que ya tiene otro mazo une los dos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write “::” between a tag and a tag inside it, as in “economía::Argentina”. The tags inside this one move with it, and a name another tag has joins the two." : {
      "comment" : "Under the title of the Cards window's sheet that renames a tag.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Escribí «::» entre una etiqueta y una etiqueta de adentro, como en «economía::Argentina». Las etiquetas de adentro de esta se mueven con ella, y un nombre que ya tiene otra etiqueta une las dos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yellow" : {
      "comment" : "One of Finder's tag colors, which a tag can have.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Amarillo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You already have a type named “%@”, so nothing changed. Pick that type, or write another name." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ya tenés un tipo llamado «%@», así que no cambió nada. Elegí ese tipo, o escribí otro nombre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can't undo this, but the daily backups in Settings › Backups hold what it deletes." : {
      "comment" : "The last sentence of the Cards window's question before it deletes a deck.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No podés deshacerlo, pero los respaldos diarios de Configuración › Respaldos guardan lo que elimina."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can't undo this." : {
      "comment" : "The last sentence of the Cards window's question before it deletes tags.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No podés deshacerlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You restored a copy of your cards. Turning sync on replaces iCloud's copy with this Mac's." : {
      "comment" : "Settings, under Sync, after the user restored a backup, which turned sync off: turning it on replaces the cards in iCloud, and on the user's other devices, with this Mac's.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Restauraste una copia de tus tarjetas. Activar la sincronización reemplaza la copia de iCloud con la de esta Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You went through every card." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pasaste por todas las tarjetas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You went through every card. More can come: the ones that didn't fit, then the closest to being due." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pasaste por todas las tarjetas. Pueden venir más: las que no entraron, y después las más cercanas a estar pendientes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your cards, their progress and the inbox stay the same on each of your devices, through your own iCloud. Each device keeps its own backups." : {
      "comment" : "Settings, under Sync, below the switch: what sync does.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tus tarjetas, su progreso y la bandeja son iguales en cada uno de tus dispositivos, a través de tu propio iCloud. Cada dispositivo guarda sus propios respaldos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your question about card %lld was approved or discarded outside the review panel, so ⌘Z can't take it back. If it became cards you don't want, delete them in the Cards window." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu pregunta sobre la tarjeta %lld se aprobó o se descartó fuera del panel de repaso, así que ⌘Z no puede deshacerla. Si se convirtió en tarjetas que no querés, eliminalas en la ventana Tarjetas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
