          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS gave no folder for the App Group %@, which holds your cards. Quit the app and open it again, and if it keeps happening, report it." : {
      "comment" : "An alert at launch, and in the widget, under that it can't read the cards. The value is the App Group's identifier, such as ABCDE12345.com.lucastkacz.ficha, which stays as it is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS no dio ninguna carpeta para el App Group %@, que guarda tus tarjetas. Salí de la app y volvé a abrirla y, si sigue pasando, reportalo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS refused the shortcut (error %d). Restart the app, and if it keeps failing, report it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
